                    {
                        "sense_id": "836d66cb-eab0-3500-9450-c9df7da59b28",
                        "entry_id": "43c0b8df-dd7d-3b65-8591-fabc9491ea01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "kopje koffie dat uit gelijke delen espresso, melk en melkschuim bestaat; espresso waaraan men melkschuim toevoegt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c638c736-9ca2-492d-8605-5e16b1cf637b",
                                "sense_id": "836d66cb-eab0-3500-9450-c9df7da59b28",
                                "text": "Ik vind het erg lekker om 's ochtends cappuccino te drinken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6da56d23-f994-475a-a5c0-f53d5a09cd59",
                                "sense_id": "836d66cb-eab0-3500-9450-c9df7da59b28",
                                "text": "Techniek en melksoort doen ertoe bij het maken van schuim voor cappuccino."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b43d09ca-a82d-4b47-9da9-cc3e44a1d04b",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c0b8df-dd7d-3b65-8591-fabc9491ea01",
                        "source_sense_id": "836d66cb-eab0-3500-9450-c9df7da59b28",
                        "source_sense_description": "kopje koffie dat uit gelijke delen espresso, melk en melkschuim bestaat",
                        "target_lang_word": "Cappuccino",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Cappuccino",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                        "entry_id": "cdf7bfe4-3f60-3afb-a3a1-fc0e7acb7a67",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "italienisches Kaffeegetränk, bestehend aus etwa gleichen Teilen von Espresso, heißer Milch und heißem Milchschaum"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7946d1dd-3e6c-4f3a-9537-293b650b2500",
                                                "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                                "text": "Einen Cappuccino genießen ist fast wie Urlaub in Italien."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b61837e-da34-4992-829f-348b0cd2455a",
                                                "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                                "text": "Nach dem Essen trinke ich immer einen Cappuccino oder einen Espresso."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df162cc7-a373-4081-80fa-230d0afda1df",
                                                "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                                "text": "„Einerseits verwunderlich, andererseits schon wieder logisch ist dann die Tatsache, dass durch das vermehrte Auftauchen von hübsch anzuschauenden, schaumgekrönten Kaffeespezialitäten à la Cappuccino, Latte Macchiato oder Milchkaffee auch die Damenwelt ungetrübte Freude an dem schwarzen Trank bekommt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59ea8153-060f-4895-847e-efdd58bf8e61",
                                                "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                                "text": "„Ich saß also dort, und ungefähr fünfundzwanzig Kellner haben mir einen Cappuccino zubereitet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "551a3063-3b47-4e8b-a3e5-baf71487f406",
                                                "sense_id": "96eedc7c-c27d-36fc-b044-2a1aee3c5c6e",
                                                "text": "„Zwischen geeisten Cappuccinos und Clubsandwich bekomme ich einen Crashkurs in aktueller griechischer Innenpolitik.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f99b48a-67e8-452f-8524-d235381465bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "43c0b8df-dd7d-3b65-8591-fabc9491ea01",
                        "source_sense_id": "836d66cb-eab0-3500-9450-c9df7da59b28",
                        "source_sense_description": "kopje koffie dat uit gelijke delen espresso, melk en melkschuim bestaat",
                        "target_lang_word": "cappuccino",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cappuccino",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                        "entry_id": "122db34e-e3dc-3ef5-910e-cd826ab33b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An Italian coffee-based beverage made from espresso to which milk that has been steamed and/or frothed is added; (countable) a cup of this beverage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b28aeb5-6110-4b1c-8dcf-1c18c4ffac62",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                                "text": "Caffè latte (served only in the morning) is coffee mixed with milk; cappuccino, or small cup, cheaper; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b74a2bc-d161-4de8-ba4b-08a47fe6cc30",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                                "text": "“What will you have? A cappuccino? Two cappuccini,” […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6e383d8-71b5-4236-9ff7-595e77f0efaf",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                                "text": "The waiter kissed his fingertips. “We have the best ice cream,” he announced. “Made on the premises. We have vanilla, cherry, rum, banana, strawberry—” / Jack stopped him. “You’ve hooked me,” he said. “Bring a dish of banana.” / “With hot chocolate sauce?” / “The works.” / “Nuts?” / “Everything!” / “And two cappuccini?” / “I think I’ll live dangerously and have a plain coffee with Amaretto on the side,” Jade said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cb1ee40-c052-43dc-a866-332a1d72c86e",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                                "text": "Formerly used only in Italy and Seattle, it includes such tongue activators as latte, lungo, cappuccino, ristretto, macchiato, mochaccino and Americano."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3bca229e-445d-491c-8ec4-59fe4e256af3",
                                                "sense_id": "e8ee24d7-2dbd-3884-823c-9411711d2f88",
                                                "text": "Cesare brought over three cappuccini."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "449a61b2-d65a-31ee-8440-948770135479",
                                        "entry_id": "122db34e-e3dc-3ef5-910e-cd826ab33b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various similar drinks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5d54b3b-f953-4127-83da-a17195dd13db",
                                                "sense_id": "449a61b2-d65a-31ee-8440-948770135479",
                                                "text": "In fact, a step from the corner of Grant Avenue and Broadway is a café called “La Tosca.” Scenes from the opera are painted on the walls; [Enrico] Caruso sings from the juke box, and you drink a cappuccino, gray, like the robe of a capuchin monk, and made of chocolate that is laced with brandy or rum, and heated by steam forced through coffee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b25a4826-366e-3c03-97a3-622c22f3514b",
                                        "entry_id": "122db34e-e3dc-3ef5-910e-cd826ab33b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A medium- to dark-brown colour like that of the coffee drink (sense 1) or the habit of a Capuchin monk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "also",
                                            "attributive",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e89f46e2-7d8b-4072-af6d-4e443b1ed1f2",
                                                "sense_id": "b25a4826-366e-3c03-97a3-622c22f3514b",
                                                "text": "This Morning We Present The \"Times Square\"—a hat for gentlemen who appreciate the importance of correct attire. […] English Grey or Cappuccino Brown"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4b25ea0b-7786-4416-8655-5c1caf500510",
